      "updated": 1780748715252,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hiring: \n- For each career\nbranch:\n- Everyone secretly\nbids influence for\npresident role, only\nwinner pays the cost\n- Managers promote\nplayers to positions\n\nWorking:\n- For each career\nbranch:\n- Each career level\nexecutes their abilities\nin turns",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
